 sec(4,'F-04 / F-05 / F-06 / F-07',f'Independent C wrapper calls official entry points and external Rust CLI calls the frozen crate. SIG18 cell 36 equals nm[4] = 0.8138793716641407, cell 35 = 0.8201342464748338; total bits `401fc356fc47a15a` match Round 1. SIG23 total is 4.7508434035893385. Band-20-only total is 0.3999999999999986 (the binary64 computed result of `24.0-23.6`, within rounding error of mathematical 0.4); all first-band cells are zero. Across 13 sequences, total max {Nmax:.17e}, specific max {Smax:.17e}; four tail maxima {Tmax:.17e} and {TSmax:.17e}. Stationary nine-level-input maxima {sn:.17e} and {ss:.17e}. All acceptance thresholds pass.',f'獨立 C wrapper 呼叫官方入口，外部 Rust CLI 呼叫凍結 crate。SIG18 cell 36 等於 nm[4] = 0.8138793716641407，cell 35 = 0.8201342464748338；總量 bits `401fc356fc47a15a` 與 Round 1 相同。SIG23 總量 4.7508434035893385。只有 band 20 非零時總量為 0.3999999999999986（`24.0-23.6`，數學 0.4 的 binary64 計算結果），第一 band 各格全 0。13 序列最大總量差 {Nmax:.17e}、比響度差 {Smax:.17e}；四尾點最大差 {Tmax:.17e}／{TSmax:.17e}。九組頻帶位準穩態最大差 {sn:.17e}／{ss:.17e}。所有驗收門檻通過。')
