 sec(5,'Diagnostic / 診斷',f'Using identical Rust NL vectors, epsilon-zero/binary64-slope-table C has total max {diagN:.17e}, reproducing the prior slope-stage claim (not a full-pipeline claim). Finding: specific max {diagS:.17e}; removing epsilon changes sample ownership because 9 float32 0.1 increments give 0.9000000134110451 > 0.9. Replacing only grid accumulation with integer-index/10 in a diagnostic control reduces specific max to {gridS:.17e}, without changing total. Making all C constants binary64 yields full-pipeline total max {fullN:.17e}; it does not prove 1.5e-14 end-to-end. Diffs, coordinates and hashes are delivered. None of these diagnostic variants replaces the authorized 0.24f reference.',f'給定相同 Rust NL 向量，epsilon=0／slope 表 binary64 的 C 總量最大差 {diagN:.17e}，重現先前 slope 階段宣稱（並非完整 pipeline 宣稱）。發現：比響度最大差 {diagS:.17e}；拿掉 epsilon 後格點歸屬改變，因 9 次 float32 0.1 累加為 0.9000000134110451 > 0.9。純診斷控制只改格線為整數索引／10，比響度最大差降至 {gridS:.17e}，總量不變。整份 C 常數全改 binary64，端到端總量最大差 {fullN:.17e}，不證明端到端 1.5e-14。交付 diff、座標與 hash；各診斷版均不取代授權的 0.24f 參考。')
 sec(6,'Contracts / 契約','Both versions pass 73,116/73,116 official reference points, with minimum margin 0.059702781183555126 (signal 2, specific 1.0 Bark, worksheet G17). Four chunked signals, 4,136 frames per version, have zero N and derived-time bit differences. Seven grid lengths and all nine DLL exports match; headers are byte-identical. Supplemental FFI panic tests pass 17/17 and C smoke passes. cbindgen 0.29.4 regeneration differs in line endings only and is identical after LF normalization. Finding/gap: both public StreamFrame versions expose no specific loudness and no floating time_axis; time is derived from the frame index. Public stream-specific equality cannot be tested. This pre-existing capability gap is not a regression or independent release blocker. Workbook derived Nmax/N5 summaries are outside the reference-point count.','兩版官方參考點均 73,116／73,116 通過，最小餘裕 0.059702781183555126（訊號 2、比響度 1.0 Bark、工作表 G17）。四訊號自訂 chunk、每版 4,136 幀，N 與推導時間位元差為 0。七組格線與九個 DLL exports 相同，header 位元相同。補充 FFI panic 測試 17／17 與 C smoke 通過；cbindgen 0.29.4 再生僅行尾不同，LF 正規化後相同。發現／缺口：兩版公開 StreamFrame 均無比響度及浮點 time_axis；時間由 frame index 推導。無法驗公開 stream-specific 相等。此為既有能力缺口，不是回歸或獨立發布阻擋。工作簿衍生 Nmax／N5 摘要未納入參考點數。')
 sec(7,'Hashes / 雜湊','All four Windows and four Linux scalar/AVX2 × zero/mosqito_tail N/specific/time tuples equal frozen platform constants exactly. Windows wheel Python N hashes and time also match. Four Windows Round 1 specific hashes were rerun in a separate target and match the old release table; an initial shared-target cache result was rejected as invalid evidence. No CPU/UCRT allowance was needed. Exact expected/observed hex values are in gates-results.json.','Windows 與 Linux 各四組 scalar／AVX2 × zero／mosqito_tail 的 N／specific／time 均與平台凍結值完全相同。Windows wheel 的 Python N／time hash 亦相同。四組 Windows Round 1 specific 舊 hash 已於獨立 target 重跑且符合舊表；初次共享 target 的快取結果被排除為無效證據，無須動用 CPU／UCRT 差異容許。期望與實測 hex 見 gates-results.json。')
