 sec(9,'Record consistency / 紀錄一致性','Versions, CITATION exception, changelog markers and CI py hash setting match. All 54 C-table numeric entries (including Round 1 and stationary values) match printed rounding. Gate counts and frozen hashes reproduce. Finding: release commit table represents 11 of 12 commits and omits `5bbbb93228b9972c0277415bebd565364de974fc`; therefore this item is FAILED. Also correct metadata-only-date wording and avoid claiming unavailable public stream-specific proof. Historical RED-run provenance and prior Linux runs are not recreated as historical events; current candidate/isolated Round 1/Linux evidence is supplied. This is a documentation finding, not evidence of a numeric defect.','版本、CITATION 已揭露例外、CHANGELOG 標記與 CI py hash 設定符合。C 表共 54 個數字（含 Round 1、穩態）均符合打印捨入；gate 計數與凍結 hash 重現。發現：release commit 表 12 筆只表示 11 筆，漏列 `5bbbb93228b9972c0277415bebd565364de974fc`，故本項 FAILED。另應修正 metadata 只有日期變動的描述，避免宣稱不可取得的公開 stream-specific 證據。歷史 RED 執行與過往 Linux 執行不冒稱重建歷史事件；本輪提供 candidate／隔離 Round 1／Linux 當前證據。此為文件發現，不是數值缺陷證據。')
